                          "fill": "$text",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "OCA subscription_oca carries recurring billing on community Odoo, so the EE sale_subscription dependency that 68 modules inherit transitively can be cut. It reads the same contract shape the NAKIVO chain already assumes, which is why the 39/39 pricing reconciliation held against real data rather than a fixture.",
